.Dd November 2, 2026
.Dt IMGURU 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm imguru
.Nd upload images to imgur.com
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl dpilcmbo
.Op Fl n
.Op Fl s Ar max_dimension
.Ar file ...
.Nm
.Fl a | w | x
.Nm
.Fl h | v
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
uploads one or more images to imgur.com and prints a link to each one.
Every image format that Mac OS X can read is accepted; images are converted
to JPEG before uploading, and can be scaled down first with
.Fl s .
.Pp
Uploads are anonymous unless an account has been signed in to with
.Fl a .
An anonymous upload belongs to no account, so it cannot be listed or deleted
afterwards.
.Pp
One line is printed per image for each output option given, in the order the
options are listed below.
If no output option is given,
.Fl d
is assumed.
.Bl -tag -width "-s max_dimension"
.It Fl d
Display a direct link to the image.
This is the default.
.It Fl p
Display a link to the image page.
.It Fl i
Display the image as an HTML
.Dq img
tag.
.It Fl l
Display the image as an HTML link.
.It Fl m
Display the image as message board
.Dq IMG
code.
.It Fl b
Display the image as message board
.Dq URL
code wrapping an
.Dq IMG .
.It Fl c
Also copy everything printed to the clipboard.
.It Fl o
Open each uploaded image in the browser.
.It Fl s Ar max_dimension
Resize the image so that its largest dimension is
.Ar max_dimension
pixels before uploading.
The aspect ratio is preserved and images smaller
than this are left alone.
.It Fl a
Sign in to an imgur account.
Subsequent uploads go to that account.
.It Fl n
Upload anonymously even when signed in.
.It Fl w
Show which account
.Nm
is signed in to, and when its access token expires.
.It Fl x
Sign out.
Uploads become anonymous again.
.It Fl h
Display help.
.It Fl v
Display the version.
.El
.Sh AUTHENTICATION
.Fl a
opens imgur.com in the browser and asks for a PIN.
Allow access on that page
and imgur shows a PIN; paste it back into the terminal to finish signing in.
The access token and refresh token are written to
.Pa ~/.imguru ,
and the access token is refreshed automatically once it expires.
.Pp
Signing in needs the imgur api client secret, which is not distributed with
the source.
Released builds have it compiled in.
To sign in from a build made
from source, add a
.Va client_secret
line to
.Pa ~/.imguru
or set
.Ev IMGUR_CLIENT_SECRET .
Without the secret
.Nm
still uploads, just anonymously.
.Pp
imgur no longer registers new api clients, so every copy of
.Nm
shares a single client id and the rate limits that go with it.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width IMGUR_CLIENT_SECRET
.It Ev IMGUR_CLIENT_SECRET
The imgur api client secret, used by
.Fl a
and when refreshing an expired access token.
Overridden by a
.Va client_secret
line in
.Pa ~/.imguru .
.It Ev HOME
Determines where
.Pa .imguru
is read from and written to.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.imguru"
.It Pa ~/.imguru
Credentials and settings, as
.Va key Ns = Ns Va value
lines.
Created readable only by its owner, because it holds an access token.
Recognised keys are
.Va access_token ,
.Va refresh_token ,
.Va expires_at ,
.Va account_username
and
.Va client_secret .
Lines beginning with
.Dq #
are ignored.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 if every image was uploaded, and 1 if any upload failed, any file
could not be read, or the options were invalid.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Upload an image and print a direct link:
.Pp
.Dl $ imguru screenshot.png
.Pp
Upload several images, scaled down, copying the links to the clipboard:
.Pp
.Dl $ imguru -c -s 1024 *.jpg
.Pp
Sign in, then upload to the account:
.Pp
.Dl $ imguru -a
.Dl $ imguru holiday.jpg
.Pp
Upload one image anonymously while signed in:
.Pp
.Dl $ imguru -n private.png
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr curl 1 ,
.Xr pbcopy 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Roland Rabien Aq Mt figbug@gmail.com
.Sh BUGS
imgur answers an invalid access token on the upload endpoint with
.Dq Too Many Requests
rather than an authentication error, so a failed upload while signed in may
mean the token needs renewing with
.Fl a .
